WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:03,540
I don’t know. Many people who went on expeditions have disappeared.

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:06,640
This world is divided into three races, the human race, the demon race, and the demon race.

3
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,140
The five states belong to the human race, and those to the south of the five states belong to the demon race.

4
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,840
To the west of the five states is the demon clan

5
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:13,040
The three tribes were divided into sections and originally did not interfere with each other.

6
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:16,140
Gradually weakening, the demons often cross the line and absorb spiritual power and human inspiration.

7
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,040
Human sects will train talented people

8
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,640
Twenty years ago, spiritual power revived in the world

9
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,640
Officially established the Special Arts Bureau to recruit talents from five states

10
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,540
Five years ago, Southern Territory was born, and branches were set up in various places.

11
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,640
The executors guard the boundaries of the festival, eliminate demons and save people

12
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:29,640
The Heavenly Master Qi Xuan and I have met, both are executors of the Special Bureau.

13
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:34,990
This is spiritual power. You also have weak spiritual power fluctuations in your body.

14
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:36,490
But I can't feel it

15
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:40,490
You have absorbed spiritual power unintentionally. Although you have not yet awakened, you can practice cultivation.

16
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:42,790
On behalf of the Special Bureau, I invite you to join. You can agree.

17
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:44,340
I join

18
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:46,940
Now that I have seen a different world, how can I be willing to continue to be an ordinary person?

19
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,850
Are you sure? You might die if you perform the mission.

20
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:52,400
Aren't you afraid of death?

21
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,400
What about you? Aren’t you afraid?
